## Article 14. Review of proposals (remarks) of citizens

```catala
declaration scope Article14ProposalReview:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input isHeroOfUSSR content YesNo
  input isHeroOfSocialistLabor content YesNo
  input isWarDisabled content YesNo
  output reviewRequired content YesNo
  output mustBeReviewedByFirstManager content YesNo
  output notificationRequired content YesNo

scope Article14ProposalReview:
  label review_required_exception default_no_review_required
  definition reviewRequired under condition
    appealType = Proposal
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_review_required
  definition reviewRequired equals Yes

  label first_manager_exception default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager under condition
    isHeroOfUSSR = Yes
    or isHeroOfSocialistLabor = Yes
    or isWarDisabled = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager equals No

  label notification_required
  definition notificationRequired equals Yes
```

## Article 15. Review of applications (petitions)

```catala
declaration scope Article15ApplicationReview:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input isHeroOfUSSR content YesNo
  input isHeroOfSocialistLabor content YesNo
  input isWarDisabled content YesNo
  input objectionSustained content YesNo
  output reviewRequired content YesNo
  output mustBeReviewedByFirstManager content YesNo
  output objectiveReviewRequired content YesNo
  output responseByReceivingAuthority content YesNo
  output refusalMustBeMotivated content YesNo
  output refusalMustReferenceLaw content YesNo

scope Article15ApplicationReview:
  label review_required_exception default_no_review_required
  definition reviewRequired under condition
    appealType = Application
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_review_required
  definition reviewRequired equals Yes

  label first_manager_exception default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager under condition
    isHeroOfUSSR = Yes
    or isHeroOfSocialistLabor = Yes
    or isWarDisabled = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager equals No

  label objective_review
  definition objectiveReviewRequired equals Yes

  label response_by_authority
  definition responseByReceivingAuthority equals Yes

  label refusal_motivated_exception default_not_motivated
  definition refusalMustBeMotivated under condition
    objectionSustained = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_motivated
  definition refusalMustBeMotivated equals No

  label refusal_law_reference
  definition refusalMustReferenceLaw equals Yes
```

## Article 16. Review of citizens' complaints

```catala
declaration scope Article16ComplaintReview:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input isAppealable content YesNo
  input hasHigherAuthority content YesNo
  output isSubmittedToHigherAuthority content YesNo
  output courtAppealRightPreserved content YesNo
  output mustBeReviewedByFirstManager content YesNo
  output complaintByAuthorizedPerson content YesNo
  output complaintByLegalRepForMinor content YesNo
  output complaintByLegalRepForIncapacitated content YesNo
  output previousDecisionsAttached content YesNo

scope Article16ComplaintReview:
  label submitted_to_higher_exception default_direct_to_court
  definition isSubmittedToHigherAuthority under condition
    appealType = Complaint and hasHigherAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_direct_to_court
  definition isSubmittedToHigherAuthority equals No

  label court_appeal_preserved
  definition courtAppealRightPreserved equals Yes

  label first_manager_exception default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager under condition
    author.category = HeroOfUSSR
    or author.category = HeroOfSocialistLabor
    or author.category = WarDisabled
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_first_manager
  definition mustBeReviewedByFirstManager equals No

  label authorized_person_exception default_not_authorized
  definition complaintByAuthorizedPerson under condition
    author.signed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_authorized
  definition complaintByAuthorizedPerson equals No

  label legal_rep_minor_exception default_not_legal_rep_minor
  definition complaintByLegalRepForMinor under condition
    author.category = Minor
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_legal_rep_minor
  definition complaintByLegalRepForMinor equals No

  label legal_rep_incapacitated_exception default_not_legal_rep_incapacitated
  definition complaintByLegalRepForIncapacitated under condition
    author.category = DeclaredIncapacitated
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_legal_rep_incapacitated
  definition complaintByLegalRepForIncapacitated equals No

  label previous_decisions
  definition previousDecisionsAttached equals Yes
```

## Article 17. Deadline for filing a complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article17ComplaintDeadline:
  input decisionDate content date
  input citizenInformedDate content date
  input complaintFiledDate content date
  input oneYearPassed content YesNo
  output withinOneMonthOfInforming content YesNo
  output withinOneYearOfDecision content YesNo
  output deadlineMissed content YesNo
  output deadlineMissedForRespectableReason content YesNo
  output deadlineCanBeRenewed content YesNo
  output complaintRejectedAsLate content YesNo
  output courtAppealAllowed content YesNo

scope Article17ComplaintDeadline:
  label within_month_exception default_not_within_month
  definition withinOneMonthOfInforming under condition
    citizenInformedDate <> Date.year_month_day 1970 1 1
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_within_month
  definition withinOneMonthOfInforming equals No

  label within_year_exception default_not_within_year
  definition withinOneYearOfDecision under condition
    decisionDate <> Date.year_month_day 1970 1 1
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_within_year
  definition withinOneYearOfDecision equals No

  label deadline_missed_exception default_deadline_ok
  definition deadlineMissed under condition
    oneYearPassed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_deadline_ok
  definition deadlineMissed equals No

  label renewable_exception default_not_renewable
  definition deadlineCanBeRenewed under condition
    deadlineMissedForRespectableReason = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_renewable
  definition deadlineCanBeRenewed equals No

  label rejected_as_late_exception default_not_rejected
  definition complaintRejectedAsLate under condition
    deadlineMissed = Yes and deadlineCanBeRenewed = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_rejected
  definition complaintRejectedAsLate equals No

  label court_appeal
  definition courtAppealAllowed equals Yes
```
